るところhttps://file.misskey.design/post/8d76b003-7611-464e-bada-9ecb49846c5e.png\n③水草に乗っているところ　https://file.misskey.design/post/093509fb-839c-4000-b2d1-107638a288f0.png\n④正面アップ　https://file.misskey.design/post/39f45737-864c-4b5d-a8e9-a384f21f9c76.png\n⑤自作の紹介漫画　https://misskey.design/notes/9fm7yt624n\nご参考までに、水草はハイグロフィラポリスペルマ、マツモ、エキノドルス、ファイヤーモスなどを入れて飼育していましたが、勿論描いていただかなくて全く問題ございません。\n\nリクエストをお受けいただけると大変嬉しいです！\n宜しくお願いいたします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 911569, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すち猫︎︎︎", "screen_name": "neru5__", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1697519329431175168/xvC0y24n.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1003614187048726533/1756886753/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 2274104, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すん", "screen_name": "sunsun_pd", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1897209495191015424/MjnE7qCx.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4146274526/1750962254/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 2689352, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "夜みち︎🌙", "screen_name": "yo_mi_chi000", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2064216347429769216/GqGp3jxY.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/p